{
  "schema_version": "argument_graph/0.1",
  "example_id": "persuade:3165FA4998BC",
  "root": "b1",
  "units": [
    {
      "id": "b1",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 46,
      "text": "Senator, we should keep the Electoral College.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b2",
      "start": 47,
      "end": 103,
      "text": "The Electoral College establishes judgement and fairness",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b3",
      "start": 104,
      "end": 146,
      "text": "by giving upcoming presidents a fair shot.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b4",
      "start": 147,
      "end": 165,
      "text": "People have voices",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "conceded",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b5",
      "start": 166,
      "end": 221,
      "text": "and the popular vote can be biased from state to state.",
      "role": "position",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b6",
      "start": 222,
      "end": 244,
      "text": "The proccess if mature",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7",
      "start": 245,
      "end": 282,
      "text": "because they chose unbiased electors,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b8",
      "start": 283,
      "end": 330,
      "text": "and there is a majority of 270 electoral votes.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b9",
      "start": 331,
      "end": 370,
      "text": "The Electoral College has 538 electors,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b10",
      "start": 371,
      "end": 416,
      "text": "which gives a good amount of unbiases people.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b11",
      "start": 417,
      "end": 521,
      "text": "They figure this amount by one for each member in the House of Representaties plus two for the Senators,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b12",
      "start": 522,
      "end": 545,
      "text": "which you could be one.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b13",
      "start": 547,
      "end": 617,
      "text": "The Electoral College is one of the best ways to keep a fair election.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b14",
      "start": 618,
      "end": 674,
      "text": "We people do not make the brightest decisions sometimes,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b15",
      "start": 675,
      "end": 783,
      "text": "and the Electoral College keeps us from making the wrong decision for who is going to be our next president.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b16",
      "start": 785,
      "end": 843,
      "text": "People can be easily affected into turning on a candidate.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b17",
      "start": 844,
      "end": 913,
      "text": "They could not realize that the candidate would be a great president.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b18",
      "start": 914,
      "end": 971,
      "text": "The Electoral College gives the candidates a fair chance.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b19",
      "start": 972,
      "end": 1055,
      "text": "The member of the Electoral College are fair and know what is best for the country.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b20",
      "start": 1056,
      "end": 1129,
      "text": "The specific Electoral electors for your state vote what the state wants,",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b21",
      "start": 1130,
      "end": 1188,
      "text": "and is not biased on what other senators or electors want.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b22",
      "start": 1189,
      "end": 1248,
      "text": "This gives the people a good amount of say in the election.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b23",
      "start": 1250,
      "end": 1293,
      "text": "Electoral Colllege keeps the people in line",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b24",
      "start": 1294,
      "end": 1340,
      "text": "and gives the people a sense of establishment.",
      "role": "claim",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b25",
      "start": 1341,
      "end": 1391,
      "text": "The election of the president is every four years.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b26",
      "start": 1392,
      "end": 1487,
      "text": "This gives people time to decide on a new president and who they want representing their votes.",
      "role": "evidence",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b27",
      "start": 1488,
      "end": 1574,
      "text": "Overall the Electoral College is one of the brightest decisions that America has made.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b28",
      "start": 1575,
      "end": 1654,
      "text": "For one the Electoral College gives people a fair chance in becoming president.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b29",
      "start": 1655,
      "end": 1725,
      "text": "Also the Electoral College helps make the voting process a lot easier.",
      "role": "concluding_summary",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b30",
      "start": 1727,
      "end": 1833,
      "text": "We people don't yet understand why there are not more people realizing that there is an Electoral College,",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    },
    {
      "id": "b31",
      "start": 1834,
      "end": 1896,
      "text": "and what underlies is a great idea and even a better reality .",
      "role": "unannotated",
      "stance": "endorsed",
      "polarity": "positive"
    }
  ],
